; chan_sip semantic: when set + domain_list non-empty, use From or To header
; domain (if it matches a configured domain) as auth realm in WWW-Authenticate
; digest challenge instead of fixed sofia_cfg.realm. Use case: multi-tenant
; SIP servers where each tenant has its own auth realm tied to its domain.
; Operators populate domain_list via [general] domain= entries (existing
; CHECKSIPDOMAIN dialplan function infrastructure).
