; domain_list infrastructure already — leverage path established).
; helper sofia_get_realm_for_dialog extracted at 3 auth-
; challenge callsites (sofia_check_lockuseragent + sofia_send_auth_challenge
; unknown-peer + MOH SUBSCRIBE unknown-peer). chan_sofia centralizes
; realm-resolution
; (chan_sip get_realm pre-resolves at p->realm; chan_sofia centralizes
; resolution at the auth-challenge emission sites for the same chan_sip-
; faithful semantic).
