;     and tenant2.example.com configured via domain= entries; REGISTER From:
;     <sip:user@tenant1.example.com> gets "tenant1.example.com" as realm in
;     WWW-Authenticate digest challenge (per-tenant auth realm)
;   * operators NOT setting domainsasrealm get default 0 = chan_sip drop-in
;     baseline preserved (sofia_cfg.realm used as auth realm uniformly)
