;domainsasrealm = yes

;
; --- allowexternaldomains (chan_sip parity, multi-tenant security) ---
; chan_sip semantic: when clear (allowexternaldomains=no) + domain_list non-
; empty + Request-URI/Refer-To domain not in domain_list → reject INVITE/REFER
; with 403 Forbidden. Use case: multi-tenant SIP servers gate domain-traversal
; attacks (prevent attacker INVITE-routed via your server to external SIP
; domains where you have no authority). Default yes (PERMISSIVE) per chan_sip
; drop-in.
