; chan_sofia implements this — leverages the existing domain_
; list infrastructure + the sofia_get_realm_for_dialog helper
; from domainsasrealm. helper sofia_check_sip_domain
; extracted as generic walker; retroactive-refactor of func_sofia_check_
; sipdomain + sofia_get_realm_for_dialog to use new helper
; eliminates 3-site walker pattern duplication. chan_sofia centralizes
; domain-validation across
; 4 callsites (2 INVITE/REFER gate + 1 realm + 1 dialplan).
