; Special-case auto-set: when operator explicitly disables BUT no domain=
; entries configured → auto-revert to allow=yes + LOG_WARNING (mirroring
; chan_sip.c:30056-30058 verbatim safety net — no point disabling external
; when no local domains defined).
;
; Operator action items:
;   * operators with chan_sip [general] allowexternaldomains=yes (default)
;     migrate verbatim zero-rewrite — drop-in PARSE+EFFECT preserved
;   * operators with chan_sip-parity multi-tenant security gating set
;     allowexternaldomains=no + populate domain= entries; INVITE/REFER to
;     non-local domains rejected with 403 Forbidden (full chan_sip-faithful
;     implementation via the sofia_check_sip_domain helper)
;   * operators NOT setting allowexternaldomains get default 1 (PERMISSIVE)
;     = chan_sip drop-in baseline preserved
;   * operators with allowexternaldomains=no + no domain= entries get auto-
;     revert with LOG_WARNING (operator-friendly safety net; chan_sip parity)
;
; Reload-required note: changing allowexternaldomains=
; requires `module reload chan_sofia.so` to update parsed value.
;
;allowexternaldomains = no

;
; --- autodomain (chan_sip parity, auto-add system addresses) ---
; chan_sip semantic: when set, auto-add system listening-addresses + FQDN to
; domain_list at module-load conclusion. Operator skips manual `domain=` entries
; for the gabpbx host's own listening addresses. chan_sofia auto-adds 5 types
; mirroring chan_sip.c:30295-30340+ verbatim:
;   (1) bindaddr IP — Sofia primary listener (skip wildcard 0.0.0.0)
;   (2) tlsbindaddr IP — TLS listener if configured (multi-transport)
;   (3) wsbindaddr IP — WebSocket listener if configured (WSS support)
;   (4) externaddr IP — NAT-traversal external address if configured
;   (5) gethostname() FQDN — system hostname (chan_sip parity at L30337+)
;
; chan_sip parity citations: chan_sip.c:29869-29870 verbatim [general] parser
; ast_true (LOCAL var auto_sip_domains in reload_config function-scope NOT
; sip_cfg member; chan_sofia mirror = sofia_cfg member for parse-compat +
; display + auto-add) + chan_sip.c:29311 verbatim local-var default-init =
; FALSE + chan_sip.c:30295-30340+ verbatim COMPREHENSIVE auto-add list. CLI
; ABSENT chan_sip — does NOT display autodomain at sip show settings
; (chan_sofia extension IN-SCOPE).
;
; chan_sofia implements this — leverages the existing domain_
; list infrastructure + the sofia_check_sip_domain helper
; (from allowexternaldomains) + the sofia_get_realm_for_dialog helper
; (from domainsasrealm). helper sofia_domain_list_add
; extracted as generic mutator with duplicate-check via the sofia_check_sip_domain helper; retroactive-
; refactor of existing chan_sofia.c domain= parser to use new helper eliminates
; mutation-pattern duplication. 6 implementation callsites total: 5 NEW auto-add sites
; (bindaddr + tlsbindaddr + wsbindaddr + externaddr + gethostname) + 1
; retroactive existing domain= parser. chan_sofia centralizes
; domain-list-mutation across config + auto-add.
;
; chan_sofia extension: sip show settings displays "Auto Domain: yes/no" at
; runtime — chan_sip silent at this CLI (chan_sip does NOT display autodomain).
; Additional operator visibility.
;
; Order matters in sofia_load_config conclusion: autodomain auto-add fires
; BEFORE allowexternaldomains special-case auto-set so the gating logic sees
; the auto-added domains as "domain_list non-empty".
;
; Operator action items:
;   * operators with chan_sip [general] autodomain=yes migrate verbatim zero-
;     rewrite — drop-in PARSE+EFFECT preserved (5 chan_sofia auto-add sites
;     mirror chan_sip 5+ auto-add types)
;   * operators with autodomain=no (default) get drop-in compat (no auto-add;
;     operators must add manual domain= entries for local SIP domains)
;   * operators NOT setting autodomain get default 0 = chan_sip drop-in
;     baseline preserved
;   * operator runs sip show settings — sees "Auto Domain: yes/no" display
;     (14th field; chan_sofia extension over chan_sip CLI absence)
;
; Reload-required note: changing autodomain= requires
; `module reload chan_sofia.so` to update parsed value; auto-add fires fresh
; at each reload (existing domain_list entries from manual domain= persist;
; auto-added entries re-evaluated against current bindaddr/tlsbindaddr/
; wsbindaddr/externaddr/gethostname).
;
;autodomain = yes

;
; --- promiscredir (chan_sip parity, parse-compatibility only) ---
; chan_sip semantic: when set + outbound INVITE returns 3xx Moved Temporarily
; → ast_string_field_build call_forward to "SIP/contact_number@host" format
; (allows remote peer to redirect outbound call via dialplan call-forward
; mechanism). When clear (default), chan_sip IGNORES 3xx Contact (security
; default; prevents un-trusted 3xx from hijacking outbound call routing).
;
; chan_sip parity citations: chan_sip.c:28173-28175 verbatim parser
; ast_set2_flag SIP_PROMISCREDIR via handle_common_options indirection
; (per-peer L28671 + [general] L29544 share single parser branch) +
; sip.h:251 verbatim flag bit (1<<11) + sip.h:295 SIP_FLAGS_TO_COPY mask
; peer→dialog inheritance + chan_sip.c:20907-20925 verbatim use site at
; 3xx Contact handler + 4 display sites L18681 sip show peer + L18801 AMI
; SIPshowpeer + L19274 sip show settings + L19817 sip show channel
; (chan_sofia 4th display DEFERRED — sip show channel
; infrastructure verification needed; future ship).
;
; chan_sofia design rationale: sofia-sip exposes nua_r_redirect event
; (nua.h:151) but chan_sofia does NOT currently handle it — no infrastructure
; to gate. **sofia-sip NUTAG_AUTO_TARGET verified ABSENT** in sofia-sip-1.13
; (grep zero-hits across nua_tag.h+sip_tag.h+nta_tag.h+tport_tag.h+sdp.h);
; sofia-sip's 3xx semantic is event-based (nua_r_redirect fires to
; application) NOT auto-follow tag-based. parse-compatibility only: parse +
; store + display but NO behavioral implementation.
;
; KNOWN LIMITATION: promiscredir=yes operators get parse-clean migration but
; chan_sofia continues to ignore 3xx redirects regardless of flag value.
; Future-fix path: implement nua_r_redirect handler + 3xx Contact parser +
; ast_channel.call_forward setter (~80-120 LoC follow-up if operator demand
; surfaces).
;
; Operator action items:
;   * operators with chan_sip [general or per-peer] promiscredir= migrate
;     verbatim zero-rewrite — parse-clean migration; effective behavior
;     deferred (chan_sofia continues to ignore 3xx redirects regardless of
;     flag value)
;   * operators wanting chan_sip 3xx-honor semantic for call-forward
;     dialplan routing: KNOWN LIMITATION (chan_sofia infrastructure ABSENT;
;     future-fix path documented above)
;   * operators NOT setting promiscredir get default 0 (FALSE) = chan_sip
;     drop-in baseline preserved (3xx ignored uniformly)
;
; Reload-required note: changing promiscredir= requires
; `module reload chan_sofia.so` to update parsed value (no behavioral
; effect — chan_sofia continues to ignore 3xx regardless).
